---
// Minimal launch privacy policy. Includes the two audit-tool-specific
// disclosures the spec requires: AI-assisted review + contract retention.
// Copy status: DRAFT pending brand-voice pass and counsel review.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | XCap Factoring"
  description="How XCap Factoring handles your contact details and uploaded contracts."
>
  <main class="section-pad">
    <div class="container-page max-w-2xl">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="display h2 mb-8">Privacy policy</h1>

      <div class="space-y-8 body-copy">
        <section>
          <h2 class="display h3 mb-2">What we collect</h2>
          <p>
            When you run a contract audit we collect your name, email, phone number, and the contract file you upload. That is
            the whole list. We do not run a credit pull and we do not ask for financials.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="display h3 mb-2">How your contract is used</h2>
          <p>
            Your contract is used only to prepare your audit and the human follow-up on it. It is stored privately, is never
            shared with third parties, and is never shown to other visitors. The audit report you see never names your current
            factoring company.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="display h3 mb-2">AI-assisted review</h2>
          <p>
            An AI system assists the first pass of your audit: it reads the document and extracts the terms, and our own
            software computes the numbers. Uploaded documents are processed through the Anthropic API under its standard
            commercial terms; Anthropic does not use API data to train its models. A human reviews the findings before anything
            is confirmed to you.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="display h3 mb-2">Retention</h2>
          <p>
            Uploaded contracts and audit records are kept for up to 90 days and then deleted automatically, unless we are
            actively working on a placement for you. Want it gone sooner? Ask, and we delete it on request.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="display h3 mb-2">How we contact you</h2>
          <p>
            We contact you about your audit using the details you submitted, only with the consent you gave on the form. Reply
            or ask at any time to stop hearing from us.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="display h3 mb-2">Questions or deletion requests</h2>
          <p>
            Use the contact details in the footer. Deletion requests are honored, no questions asked.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
